  "body": "### What is the issue with the Fetch Standard?\r\n\r\nIn [initialize a response](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#initialize-a-response) algorithm:\r\n> 2. If init[\"statusText\"] does not match the reason-phrase token production, then throw a TypeError.\r\n\r\nbut [reason-phrase](https://httpwg.org/specs/rfc9112.html#status.line) token production requires at least one characters:\r\n\r\n> reason-phrase  = 1*( HTAB / SP / VCHAR / obs-text )\r\n\r\nso if `init[\"statusText\"]` is a empty string \"\", this step would fail.",
